(1)     233 :                    *** Unsigned Divide: dividend / divisor = quotient ... remainder
(1)     233 :                    *** @param R1 dividend
(1)     233 :                    *** @param R2 divisor
(1)     233 :                    *** @return R0 quotient
(1)     233 :                    *** @return R1 remainder
(1)     233 :                    *** @clobber R2
